### IllusionTemple::Timing ###
	WarningTime/NotifyTime/EventTime/CloseTime in minutes.

### IllusionTemple::Schedule::StartTime ###
	One or more scheduled triggers, matched against the real-world
	clock (-1 = any/wildcard for that field):
	Year/Month/Day/DayOfWeek/Hour/Minute/Second.

### IllusionTemple::ExperienceSettings::Experience ###
	Level 0-5 (MAX_IT_LEVEL) - Table1/Table2 experience reward
	values for that difficulty level.

### IllusionTemple::RewardSettings::Reward ###
	Level 0-5 - WC/WP/GP (WCoinC/WCoinP/GoblinPoint) and
	GensContribution (Gens Family points, 0 = none) paid for
	clearing that difficulty level.

### IllusionTemple::EntryLevelMgDlRf / EntryLevelStandard ###
	Which Illusion Temple level (0-5) a character can enter, based on
	combined Level + MasterLevel. MgDlRf applies to Magic Gladiator/
	Dark Lord/Rage Fighter, Standard to everyone else.
	MinLevel/MaxLevel, -1 on MaxLevel = unbounded.

### IllusionTemple::DailyEntryLimit ###
	Vip0-3 - max entries per day (any level combined) for that VIP
	tier, -1 = unlimited. Resets at midnight server time, in-memory
	only (not persisted across restarts).

### IllusionTemple::EntrySettings::Entry ###
	Level 0-5:
	MaxUser         Player cap for that level (hard ceiling MAX_IT_USER=10).
	MinAccountLevel Minimum VIP tier required, -1 = none.
	MinReset/MaxReset/MinMasterReset/MaxMasterReset
	                Reset range restrictions, 0 on the Max fields = unbounded.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

